{"chunk_id": "21fd9c15d4b6", "text": "This section interweaves Sita\u2019s steadfast virtue with the turning point of Rama\u2019s search. Ravana attempts to seduce Sita in the Ashoka grove, boasting of his power, lineage, and vast dominion, but she rejects him with unwavering loyalty to Rama, condemning his lack of virtue and weeping in grief. Meanwhile, Rama, dwelling on Mount Malyavat with Lakshmana, grows impatient with Sugriva for delaying the search for Sita. Sugriva explains that search parties have been sent across the world. When the southern party returns after raiding the royal orchard\u2014signaling success\u2014Hanuman recounts their journey: meeting the vulture Sampati, learning Sita is in Lanka, and Hanuman\u2019s leap across the ocean. He confirms he found Sita in Ravana\u2019s palace, delivered Rama\u2019s message, received her jewel as proof, and burned Lanka before returning. The episode marks the moment hope becomes certainty in Rama\u2019s quest.\nRavana tries to seduce Sita and is rejected; Rama pressures Sugriva for action; Hanuman returns reporting he found Sita in Lanka.\nThemes: Sita's fidelity, Ravana's temptation, loyalty and duty, search for Sita, Hanuman's discovery", "vector": [0.0036797267384827137, -0.026550695300102234, 0.005963113624602556, 0.0025785069447010756, -0.011184210889041424, 0.0287092886865139, -0.025619802996516228, -0.0020961964037269354, -0.02930290251970291, -0.025687258690595627, 0.024338137358427048, 0.022651737555861473, 0.0140713294968009, 0.00684678740799427, -0.001986580202355981, -0.004684821702539921, 0.04786680266261101, -0.002109687542542815, 0.025012698024511337, -0.021383563056588173, -0.01500222273170948, -0.026523713022470474, -0.016162466257810593, 0.004000143148005009, -0.021275633946061134, -0.007123357150703669, 0.022665228694677353, -0.040905341506004333, 0.022692210972309113, 0.007190813310444355, -0.012263507582247257, -0.014233223162591457, -0.024513524025678635, -0.009551774710416794, -0.0134709